acvp-keygen.json, acvp-siggen-subset.json, acvp-sigver-subset.json
    NIST ACVP-Server, gen-val/json-files/SLH-DSA-keyGen-FIPS205/internalProjection.json,
    gen-val/json-files/SLH-DSA-sigGen-FIPS205/internalProjection.json and
    gen-val/json-files/SLH-DSA-sigVer-FIPS205/internalProjection.json of
    https://github.com/usnistgov/ACVP-Server at commit 975de31eb83d87039ec88934fdc47d8c312b892d
    (2026-08-12), downloaded on 2026-10-24. acvp-keygen.json is renamed and otherwise unchanged
    (SHA-256 d7c53a1b6450087047b57aae83a5a51a0ac89ecdb23ebe071e83fbb69ae9d920).
    Changed: on 2026-10-24, to keep the repository small, acvp-siggen-subset.json was made from the sigGen
    file (SHA-256 62b42e7c27fda5de8a94aba2943ae413b59b6ea08141f3bc035b1eceae235dba, 38 MB) by keeping
    the test of the shortest message of each of its 72 groups, and acvp-sigver-subset.json from the sigVer
    file (SHA-256 a013fc2104f4ed4799d96d51141f65b965969b2cf10646626a021b6d456ce792, 31 MB) by keeping,
    in each of its 36 groups, the test of the shortest message with a valid signature and the one with
    the shortest message of one of the six reasons of failure, taken in turn from group to group so that
    every reason is kept six times; both are written as JSON with an indentation of 2, and nothing else is
    changed.
    Source: the National Institute of Standards and Technology.
